<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Werner Enterprises upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Werner Enterprises upped.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said on Thursday it raised its rating on the shares of Werner Enterprises Inc to a strong buy from a buy.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 13/16 to 21-1/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
